ns":25689,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778889690697,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9d458c2e-45f1-4196-81e8-0b158c3f6238"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call41f8164c8a344a88b50b690a58aca0b8","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"27837268 auto backup 2026-05-16\n M agents/main/sessions/32665896-081e-42d8-9198-d9818063b0bd.jsonl"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778889693363},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The commit happened successfully - \"auto backup 2026-05-16\" was committed. There's one modified file (the sessions JSONL) that wasn't included. Let me try to push and see what happens. It seems the push might have been cut off by the SIGTERM.\n\nActually wait - let me re-read the output. The commit was `27837268 auto backup 2026-05-16`. But the process exited with SIGTERM which means it was killed before it could complete `git push`. Let me check if push happened or not.\n\nActually looking more carefully at the earlier output - the commit did happen but I didn't see the \"git push\" output or the \"备份完成\" echo. \n\nSo the SIGTERM terminated the process before push could finish. I should run the push command again.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nCommit 成功了，但 push 被 SIGTERM 中断了。重新执行 push：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call077266bae1374c6d9ecaeebe52af9dc0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && git push && echo \"备份完成\"","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":25635,"output":226,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25973,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778889693373,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e28c47bf-9b1b-4318-ae74-b4d1f59d3b8f"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call077266bae1374c6d9ecaeebe52af9dc0","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","tex